      "normal": false
    },
    {
      "locator": "aft/eng/ENGINE CONTROL/1",
      "meaning": "The engine control system has a fault that stops the airplane being dispatched. It only shows on the ground with the engine running: below 80 knots before takeoff, or about 30 seconds after landing.",
